chunk and wrong values in every chunk after it. It also segfaults inside
`duckdb_v2_arrow_importer_next_chunk`, at seven rows with a three-value dictionary and an import
batch of two.

| rows | `SELECT c, count(*) FROM t GROUP BY c` |
| --- | --- |
| 2048 | 10 groups, correct |
| 2049 | 11 groups, one spurious `''` |
| 3000 | 11 groups, spurious `''` with count 952, every real group short |
| 5000 | 15 groups, spurious `''`, `'\x03\x00'`, `'\x05\x00\x00\x00'`, `'\x07\x00\x00\x00\x08\x00'` |

